    "recap": "Welcome to Day 30 of Auditing & Forensic Accounting. Today we conquer Block 6: Digital Forensics & EDRM, Cyber Incident Auditing & CERT-In, Continuous AI Auditing & Rule 11(g), Courtroom Testimony & NFRA Sanctions, and the Chief Audit Executive (CAE) Grand Master Capstone.",
